===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|economics}} The volume that tips the balance between the demand and the supply toward demand lagging supply.
# {{lb|en|architecture}} That portion of the [[roof]] structure that extends beyond the exterior walls of a building.
# A fatty roll of [[pubis]] flab that hangs over one's genitals; a [[FUPA]].
# Anything that overhangs or protrudes over its base, such as a wave immediately before breaking, or a protruding cliff or rock wall.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1983|title=Australian Transport|page=16
|passage=These are firstly for products which need a cool room; secondly for products which can be stored on a standard pallet without '''overhang'''; and thirdly for products known as "the uglies" which always overhang a standard pallet.}}

